WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.495
The Earth at night.

00:02.195 --> 00:06.184
This is the night side of the Earth, and every glow on it is a town.

00:06.634 --> 00:09.499
Some of that light never reaches a street.

00:09.949 --> 00:12.844
It goes up, or sideways, and lights the air.

00:13.294 --> 00:17.911
More than eight people in ten now live under a sky polluted by light.
